Comments to the author

The manuscript begins: "A Reference for the Language." It takes 53
steps, observes once, publishes once and leaks one obstruction.

I could not see the result. My comments concern the text.

The manuscript was retracted on line 63. I have reviewed it
anyway.

1. Line 61 is left to the reader. Please include it.

2. Line 55 says what needs to be shown. Please show it.

3. Line 54 is well known. Please give a reference.

